{
  "name": "skr-scale-answers",
  "description": "Recursive conditionals over an as-const route tree of 300 parents, a repeated infer over a 1,000-member union and 1,000 distinct alias inferences; cold Verter time and peak memory beside whole-program TypeScript wall time. The names of a 2,000-parent tree and a repeated infer over a 6,000-member union are answer obligations: every Verter answer must match tsc exactly.",
